## Model card

- **Name:** Gemini 3.5 Flash-Lite
- **Short description:** Google’s low-latency, cost-effective multimodal model optimized for high-throughput, low-cost execution, subagent tasks, and document parsing.
- **Provider / access:** Google AI Studio / Gemini API (`gemini-3.5-flash-lite`). Local metadata lists `google/gemini-3.5-flash-lite` with free tier note.
- **Release / knowledge:** Documentation reviewed 2026-11-10 (Gemini API docs). Knowledge cutoff not explicitly stated in reviewed page.
- **IDs:** `gemini-3.5-flash-lite`.
- **Context window:** 1,048,576 tokens (1M) per local metadata/docs context.
- **Modalities:** Text, image, video, audio, and PDF inputs; text output (Gemini API docs).
- **Pricing (as of 2026-11-10):** Free tier available in Google AI Studio (standard rate limits) per local metadata; paid-tier pricing varies by Google pricing docs (not fully extracted in this pass).
- **Architecture:** Proprietary Google model; architecture/parameter count not publicly disclosed.

